{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56112","headline":"步虚词 五 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道师玄寂，昇仙友无英。\n公子度灵符，太一捧洞章。\n舍利耀所以姿，龙驾倏来迎。\n天尊眄云舆，飘飘乘虚翔。\n香花若飞雪，氛霭茂玄梁。\n（同前卷六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}